{
  "id": "E412",
  "title": "You Go Outside",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2020-03-12",
  "synopsis": "Little Ming is asking his mom to go outside. How come?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50412/0d1bf0d4184b122da73ba168d4c2110984ae9088.mp3?1583765370",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你出去吧\n\n小明：妈妈，我要和你一起看动画片。\n小明的妈妈：好。我们上网看吧。\n（五分钟后）\n小明：他们怎么不动了？\n小明的妈妈：因为很多人都在看这个动画片，所以卡了。\n小明：那你出去吧。\n小明的妈妈：为什么？\n小明：你出去，可能就不卡了。",
    "traditional": "你出去吧\n\n小明：媽媽，我要和你一起看動畫片。\n小明的媽媽：好。我們上網看吧。\n（五分鐘後）\n小明：他們怎麼不動了？\n小明的媽媽：因為很多人都在看這個動畫片，所以卡了。\n小明：那你出去吧。\n小明的媽媽：為什麼？\n小明：你出去，可能就不卡了。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "You Go Outside"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小明：妈妈，我要和你一起看动画片。",
      "traditional": "小明：媽媽，我要和你一起看動畫片。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng mā ma wǒ yào hé nǐ yì qǐ kàn dòng huà piàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Mom, I want to watch a cartoon with you."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小明的妈妈：好。我们上网看吧。",
      "traditional": "小明的媽媽：好。我們上網看吧。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de mā ma hǎo wǒ men shàng wǎng kàn ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s mom: OK. Let’s watch it online."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "（五分钟后）",
      "traditional": "（五分鐘後）",
      "pinyin": "wǔ fēn zhōng hòu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "(Five minutes later)"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小明：他们怎么不动了？",
      "traditional": "小明：他們怎麼不動了？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng tā men zěn me bú dòng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Why aren’t they moving?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小明的妈妈：因为很多人都在看这个动画片，所以卡了。",
      "traditional": "小明的媽媽：因為很多人都在看這個動畫片，所以卡了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de mā ma yīn wèi hěn duō rén dōu zài kàn zhè ge dòng huà piàn suǒ yǐ kǎ le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s mom: Because a lot of people are watching this cartoon. So, it got stuck."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小明：那你出去吧。",
      "traditional": "小明：那你出去吧。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng nà nǐ chū qù ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: You go outside then."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小明的妈妈：为什么？",
      "traditional": "小明的媽媽：為什麼？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de mā ma wèi shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s mom: Why?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "小明：你出去，可能就不卡了。",
      "traditional": "小明：你出去，可能就不卡了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng nǐ chū qù kě néng jiù bù kǎ le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: If you go outside, maybe it will get unstuck."
    }
  ],
